#: port/app/ingame.cpp:195 port/app/ingame3ds.cpp:475 port/app/ingame3ds.cpp:484 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:182
#, menu
msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "グラフィック"

#: port/app/ingame.cpp:196
#, menu
msgid "Upscaling, Cemu's accuracy settings and the performance overlay. Kept for the next games."
